# Trivy ignore file for VulnBank.
# Syntax: CVE-ID or GHSA-ID, optionally with expiry date and reason.
#
# IMPORTANT: This file should only suppress vulnerabilities you have triaged.
# For a deliberately vulnerable training app you will see many OS/package CVEs.
# Start with an empty file, run the pipeline, then add entries with a reason.

# Example format:
# CVE-2023-12345 exp:2025-12-31
#   Reason: Demo app running in isolated CI only; not exposed to production.

# Python 3.9 base image CVEs often appear here. Uncomment after triage.
# CVE-2024-XXXX exp:2025-12-31
#   Base image is python:3.9-slim; upgrade to 3.11-slim or 3.12-slim planned.
